note collab/co5iss.om (ForgePatches): one issue page: title, state, author, labels, assignees, the
note patches linked to it, and the comment thread (the first comment is the issue body; edits replace
note a body, redactions hide it).
note Links (docs/FEATURES.md, read-only): a patch links an issue when its title, a revision description
note that is not redacted, or a comment that is not redacted holds issue/<h>, where "issue/" does not
note follow an ASCII letter or digit and <h> is 7 to 40 lowercase hex not followed by another hex
note digit, and exactly one issue of the repository has an id starting with <h>. At most 200 patches
note are read for an issue page (as for the lists), 64 links are kept per page.
text tcih4 " comment"
text tcireas " &#183; reason "
text tcic1 "<section class=\"box\"><p class=\"meta\">"
text tcic2 " wrote on "
text tcic3 "</p>"
text tcic4 "</section>\n"
text tcicx "<p class=\"muted\">This comment was redacted by its author.</p>"
text tcicnx "<p class=\"muted\">No comments.</p>\n"
text tctiss " - issue - "
text tclkiss "issue/"
text tclkh1 "<section class=\"box\"><h2>Linked patches</h2>\n"
text tclkno "<p class=\"muted\">No patch names this issue (<code>issue/&lt;id&gt;</code> in its title, a description or a comment).</p>\n"
text tclki1 "<p class=\"meta\">Linked issues: "
text tclkino "<p class=\"muted\">No linked issue (<code>issue/&lt;id&gt;</code> in the title, a description or a comment).</p>\n"
text tclkcm ", "
note the issue ids of the repository (distinct, at most 1024), the issue of an issue page (index in
note gliss, 9999 none) and its id
global gliss uchar 40960
global glisn ulong 1
global glme ulong 1
global glid uchar 40
note issues linked by the loaded patch: indices into gliss
global gllk ulong 64
global glln ulong 1
note patches linked to the issue of an issue page: id, title (at most 200 bytes), state
global glpi uchar 2560
global glpt uchar 12800
global glptl ulong 64
global glps ulong 64
global glpn ulong 1
fn coisspg to long
if eq corefs 2 false
ret 500
end
if eq coresolve false
ret 404
end
colsav
for k ulong 40
put glid k get gcid k
end
colpats
if eq corefs 2 false
ret 500
end
for k ulong 40
put gcid k get glid k
end
if eq coload 2 false
ret 404
end
coittl
frepohd 6
coihd
copmeta
colpsec
codrefb
coicoms
coformc 2
ret 200
end
note colsav: copy the distinct ids of the last corefs (issues) into gliss
fn colsav to void
n = get gcun 0
for j ulong n bound 1024
w = get gcui j
for k ulong 40
put gliss add mul j 40 k get gcfi add mul w 40 k
end
end
put glisn 0 n
end
note colpats: read up to 200 patches and keep those that link the issue glid
fn colpats to void
put glpn 0 0
put glme 0 9999
for j ulong get glisn 0
if colideq j
put glme 0 j
end
end
if eq corefs 1 false
ret
end
n = get gcun 0
if gt n 200
n = ulong 200
end
for i ulong n
coidref get gcui i
if coload 1
colscan
if colhas get glme 0
colkeep
end
end
end
end
fn colideq j ulong to bool
for k ulong 40
if ne get gliss add mul j 40 k get glid k
ret false
end
end
ret true
end
fn colhas x ulong to bool
for i ulong get glln 0
if eq get gllk i x
ret true
end
end
ret false
end
fn colkeep to void
i = get glpn 0
if ge i 64
ret
end
for k ulong 40
put glpi add mul i 40 k get gcid k
end
n = get gcm 1
if gt n 200
n = ulong 200
end
o = get gcm 0
for k ulong n
put glpt add mul i 200 k get gcpool add o k
end
put glptl i n
put glps i costate
put glpn 0 add i 1
end
note colscan: the issues the loaded patch links (title, descriptions and comments not redacted)
fn colscan to void
put glln 0 0
colstr get gcm 0 get gcm 1
for r ulong get gcrn 0
if eq get gcrx r 0
colstr get gcrd mul r 2 get gcrd add mul r 2 1
end
end
for q ulong get gcqn 0
if eq get gcqx q 0
colstr get gcqs mul q 2 get gcqs add mul q 2 1
end
end
end
fn colstr o ulong n ulong to void
e = add o n
t = len tclkiss
p = o
while lt add p t e bound 4194304
if colat p o
coltok add p t e
end
p = add p 1
end
end
note colat p o: gcpool[p,..) is issue/ and the byte before p (when p > o) is not a letter or digit
fn colat p ulong o ulong to bool
for i ulong len tclkiss
if ne get gcpool add p i get tclkiss i
ret false
end
end
if eq p o
ret true
end
c = get gcpool sub p 1
if and ge c 48 le c 57
ret false
end
if and ge c 65 le c 90
ret false
end
ret not and ge c 97 le c 122
end
note coltok h e: the hex run at h (7..40, not followed by hex) names exactly one issue: keep it
fn coltok h ulong e ulong to void
n = ulong 0
while and lt add h n e lt n 41 bound 41
if eq cohexc get gcpool add h n false
break
end
n = add n 1
end
if or lt n 7 gt n 40
ret
end
m = ulong 0
w = ulong 0
for j ulong get glisn 0
if colpre j h n
m = add m 1
w = j
end
end
if ne m 1
ret
end
if colhas w
ret
end
i = get glln 0
if lt i 64
put gllk i w
put glln 0 add i 1
end
end
fn colpre j ulong h ulong n ulong to bool
for k ulong n
if ne get gliss add mul j 40 k get gcpool add h k
ret false
end
end
ret true
end
note colpsec: the Linked patches section of an issue page
fn colpsec to void
fput tclkh1
if eq get glpn 0 0
fput tclkno
fput tcic4
ret
end
fput tclul
for i ulong get glpn 0
colprow i
end
fput tcluln
fput tcic4
end
fn colprow i ulong to void
fput tcli1
copatl
for k ulong 40
fputc get glpi add mul i 40 k
end
fput tcqg
n = get glptl i
if eq n 0
fput tcnot
end
for k ulong n
fescc get glpt add mul i 200 k
end
fput tcli2
costbadge 1 get glps i
cosp
fput tcsp1
for k ulong 7
fputc get glpi add mul i 40 k
end
fput tcspe
fput tcli10
end
note colisec: the linked issues of a patch page (inside its verdict box)
fn colisec to void
if eq get glln 0 0
fput tclkino
ret
end
fput tclki1
for i ulong get glln 0
if gt i 0
fput tclkcm
end
w = get gllk i
fput tcah
coissl
for k ulong 40
fputc get gliss add mul w 40 k
end
fput tcqg
fput tccode
for k ulong 8
fputc get gliss add mul w 40 k
end
fput tccodee
fput tcae
end
fput tcpend
end
note coittl: the page title carries at most 256 bytes of the title (fti is 256 bytes). The count is
note capped here: a count past the bound is trap 4, which ends the server (exit 104).
fn coittl to void
put ftil 0 0
o = get gcm 0
n = get gcm 1
for k ulong hmin n 256 bound 256
ftic get gcpool add o k
end
for k ulong len tctiss
ftic get tctiss k
end
ftirepo
end
fn coihd to void
fput tcph1
copoolm 0
if eq get gcm 1 0
fput tcnot
end
fput tcph2
coidh 7
fput tcph3
costbadge 2 get gcm 2
if gt get gcm 8 0
fput tcireas
copoolm 7
end
fput tcph4
coauth 0
fput tcph5
codate get gccts 0
fput tcmidd
fnum get gcqn 0
fput tcih4
if ne get gcqn 0 1
fputc 115
end
fput tcph6
coidh 40
fput tcph7
end
fn coicoms to void
if eq get gcqn 0 0
fput tcicnx
ret
end
for q ulong get gcqn 0
coicom q
end
end
fn coicom q ulong to void
ci = get gcqt q
fput tcic1
coauth ci
fput tcic2
codate get gccts ci
fput tcic3
if eq get gcqx q 1
fput tcicx
else
n = get gcqs add mul q 2 1
if gt n 0
comd get gcqs mul q 2 n
end
end
fput tcic4
end
